@startuml
title SSHSS SysML Block Definition Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Sentinel Security System" as System <<system>>
class "Central Control Unit" as CCU <<block>> {
  +processSensorEvents()
  +manageSecurityState()
  +authorizeUserCommands()
  +coordinateDevices()
  +storeAndSynchronizeData()
}
class "Sensor Subsystem" as Sensors <<block>> {
  +senseCondition()
  +triggerEvent()
  +reportHealth()
}
class "Motion Sensor" as Motion <<block>>
class "Door / Window Sensor" as Entry <<block>>
class "Water Leak Sensor" as Water <<block>>
class "Camera Subsystem" as Cameras <<block>> {
  +streamLiveVideo()
  +bufferAndRecordClip()
}
class "IP Camera" as Camera <<block>>
class "Alarm System" as Alarm <<block>> {
  +activateSirenAndStrobe()
  +createAlarmNotification()
}
class "Siren / Strobe" as Siren <<block>>
class "Notification Service" as Notification <<block>>
class "Controller Subsystem" as Controllers <<block>>
class "Smart Lock Controller" as Lock <<block>>
class "Smart Light Controller" as Light <<block>>
class "User Interface" as UI <<block>> {
  +displayStatusAndVideo()
  +armDisarmAcknowledge()
  +configureSystem()
}
class "Wall-mounted Panel" as Panel <<block>>
class "Mobile Application" as App <<block>>
class "Web Browser" as Browser <<block>>
class "Cloud Services" as Cloud <<block>> {
  +remoteAccessRelay()
  +deliverNotifications()
  +storeMinimalMetadata()
}
class "Power Supply" as Power <<block>> {
  +mainsInput
  +batteryBackup
  +powerMonitoring
}

System *-- "1" CCU
System *-- "1" Sensors
System *-- "1" Cameras
System *-- "1" Alarm
System *-- "1" Controllers
System *-- "1" UI
System *-- "0..1" Cloud
System *-- "1" Power

Sensors *-- "0..32" Motion
Sensors *-- "0..32" Entry
Sensors *-- "0..16" Water
Cameras *-- "0..8" Camera
Alarm *-- "1..2" Siren
Alarm *-- "1" Notification
Controllers *-- "0..8" Lock
Controllers *-- "0..16" Light
UI *-- "1" Panel
UI *-- "1" App
UI *-- "0..1" Browser

CCU ..> Sensors : «allocate» supervise / consume triggers
CCU ..> Cameras : «allocate» live view / clip requests
CCU ..> Alarm : «allocate» alarm decisions / commands
CCU ..> Controllers : «allocate» authorized physical control
UI ..> CCU : «allocate» local user interaction
UI ..> Cloud : «allocate» remote user interaction
Cloud ..> CCU : «allocate» authenticated relay / synchronization
Power ..> CCU : «allocate» conditioned / backup power
Power ..> Alarm : «allocate» backup alarm power

note right of CCU
The CCU is the authoritative central controller.
It processes and manages data and mediates between
users, sensors, cameras, alarms, and controllers.
end note
@enduml
